# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the test runs (LSAN_OPTIONS in the base test preset).
#
# Fontconfig and expat, the system libraries Qt uses to find fonts on Linux, keep a few hundred
# bytes of their parsed configuration until the process ends, and LeakSanitizer reports that as
# a leak of the program that started them when a test program exits. It is not this code's to
# fix, and every first-party leak is still reported: only allocations made inside these two
# libraries are ignored.
leak:libfontconfig.so
leak:libexpat.so
